---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" lang="en">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>
      The controller for data processing on this website is
      {SITE.owner.name} (contact details in the <a href="/en/legal-notice">legal notice</a>).
      This policy explains how personal data is processed under the Swiss
      Data Protection Act (revFADP) and, where applicable, the EU General
      Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      When you visit this website, the hosting provider processes technically
      necessary data (IP address, date and time, requested page, browser type)
      to deliver the site and keep it secure.
      <!-- TODO: name the hosting provider, e.g. Cloudflare Pages -->
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>
      This website uses Google AdSense, a service of Google Ireland Limited,
      to display advertising. AdSense uses cookies and similar technologies to
      serve ads and measure their performance; data may be transferred to
      Google in the process. Personalized advertising is only shown with your
      consent, which you can withdraw at any time via the cookie settings.
      More information:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">
        Google advertising policies</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some articles contain recommendation links labeled as ads. When you
      click such a link, the partner sets a cookie to attribute the referral.
      If you make a purchase, we receive a commission — at no extra cost to
      you.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access, rectify, and erase your personal data and
      to object to its processing. To do so, contact the address given in the
      legal notice.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
